/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 95 0 R
/T (i\) Employer-owned Asset Used by Employee: The annual benefit is 5% of the asset's cost or market value at acquisition. ii\) Rented/Hired Asset Used by Employee: The annual benefit equals the annual rent or hire paid by the employer. iii\) Employer-provided Accommodation in Nigeria: If the employee pays no rent or less than the annual rental value, the additional emolument is the annual rental value, capped at 20% of annual gross income \(excluding the rental value\).)
/E (i\) Employer-owned Asset Used by Employee: The annual benefit is 5% of the asset's cost or market value at acquisition. ii\) Rented/Hired Asset Used by Employee: The annual benefit equals the annual rent or hire paid by the employer. iii\) Employer-provided Accommodation in Nigeria: If the employee pays no rent or less than the annual rental value, the additional emolument is the annual rental value, capped at 20% of annual gross income \(excluding the rental value\).)
